Today is Thursday.
I go to the mechanic's shop.
I reach there at exactly seven o'clock.
The mechanic Dada is in the shop.
I ask him, "Hello Dada, is my bicycle ready?"
Dada smiles and says, "Yes, Madam."
"Your bicycle is completely ready."
"You are exactly on time."
I look at my bicycle.
It looks very clean and new.
I say to Dada, "Thank you very much, Dada."
"The bicycle is ready on time."
In Mumbai, I sometimes ride a bicycle.
I like to ride the bicycle sometimes.
Today is also a gym day.
After the gym I come here.
I always go to the gym on time.
I sit on my bicycle.
And I leave for home.
